          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubwo bezaga inkike y'i Yerusalemu, bashatse Abalewi aho babaga hose ngo babazane i Yerusalemu, bareme ibirori byo kuyeza banezerewe, bashimisha indirimbo bafite n'ibyuma bivuga na nebelu n'inanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi abahungu b'abaririmbyi baraterana bava mu bibaya bikikije i Yerusalemu no mu birorero by'Abanyanetofa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'i Betigilugali no mu masambu y'i Geba na Azimaveti, kuko abaririmbyi bari biyubakiye ibirorero impande zose z'i Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko abatambyi n'Abalewi bariyeza, maze beza abantu n'amarembo n'inkike.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
