          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko uwo munsi batoranya abantu bo gutegeka ibyumba by'ububiko, byo kubikamo amaturo azunguzwa n'umuganura n'ibice bya kimwe mu icumi, kugira ngo bayateranirizemo amagerero y'abatambyi n'Abalewi yategetswe mu mategeko uko amasambu y'imidugudu yari ari, kuko Abayuda banejejwe n'uko abatambyi n'Abalewi bari ku mirimo yabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
